 and HSBC: matching and netting","url":"https://www.uobgroup.com/uobgroup/newsroom/news-releases/2026/uob-cross-border-transactions-on-swift.page","date":"2026-08-26"}],"anchor":"swiftcase-swift-case-uob-hsbc","entity_ids":["ent.uob"],"links":[{"text":"Tokenized deposits: HSBC","href":"/freedom250-chronicle/library/graphics/bank-tokenized-deposits.html#bank-hsbc"},{"text":"Tokenized deposits: UOB","href":"/freedom250-chronicle/library/graphics/bank-tokenized-deposits.html#bank-uob"}]},{"key":"swiftcase:swift-case-citi-fab","face":2,"banks_text":"Citi ↔ FAB · USD","title":"Citi ↔ FAB · USD","sub":"Published 2026-09-02","text":"Completed USD pilot; FAB separately confirms correspondent settlement completed.","kv":[["Executed","Not disclosed"],["Limits of the evidence","Bank-reported controlled activity; amount, transaction logs, finality terms and loss allocation not disclosed."]],"sources":[{"label":"FAB and Citi: separate correspondent settlement","url":"https://www.bankfab.com/en-ae/about-fab/group/in-the-media/completes-tokenized-deposit-milestone-with-citi-swift-ledger","date":"2026-09-02"}],"anchor":"swiftcase-swift-case-citi-fab","entity_ids":["ent.citi"],"links":[{"text":"Tokenized deposits: Citi","href":"/freedom250-chronicle/library/graphics/bank-tokenized-deposits.html#bank-citi"}]},{"key":"swiftcase:swift-case-citi-ocbc","face":2,"banks_text":"Citi ↔ OCBC · USD","title":"Citi ↔ OCBC · USD","sub":"Published 2026-09-02","text":"Completed USD live pilots in Citi’s July–December controlled proof of concept.","kv":[["Executed","Not disclosed"],["Limits of the evidence","Bank-reported controlled activity; amount, transaction logs, finality terms and loss allocation not disclosed."]],"sources":[{"label":"Citi: controlled live proof of concept","url":"https://www.citigroup.com/global/news/press-release/2026/citi-services-pioneers-live-transactions-swift-ledger-fab-ocbc-redefine-always-on-global-payments","date":"2026-09-02"}],"anchor":"swiftcase-swift-case-citi-oc